    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/df/Unchou_Kanu_Seito_Warlord_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251018002611\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Unchou Kanu Seito Warlord Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/df/Unchou_Kanu_Seito_Warlord_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20251018002611\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"586\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Unchou Kanu Seito Warlord Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Unchou_Kanu_Seito_Warlord_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">外观</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnchou_Kanu%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>关羽是一位高大且胸部丰满的深色皮肤年轻女子，一头深紫色长发一直垂到脚边，发尾扎在一起，刘海遮住左眼，两侧各有一缕垂至胸前的发丝，眼睛为浅蓝灰色。\n\n</p><p>她通常穿着圣都学园的校服，包括一件暴露的白色水手服上衣，带有蓝色条纹和黄色蝴蝶结，配套的蓝色短裙，白色宽松袜子，以及棕色鞋子。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">性格</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnchou_Kanu%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>关羽是一个非常忠诚的人。这一点在她为了保护首领而自愿被敌人俘获时得到了体现。关羽似乎也对刘备非常宽容，只要刘备和她或张飞在一起，就听之任之。\n\n</p><p>Kan-u也非常自豪于自己的武艺和名声，正如她曾不断不懈地训练，不只为保护Gentoku，也为了向所有人证明她配得上‘Unchou Kan-u’这个称号。\n\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f6bfd105b5c889820f97e00c72f3aad6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Unchou_Kan-u_Seito_Warlord_S_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:74px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Unchou_Kan-u_Seito_Warlord_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Unchou Kan-u Seito Warlord S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (244 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:74px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/53/Unchou_Kan-u_Seito_Warlord_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20251018002840\" title=\"Unchou Kan-u Seito Warlord S Queen&#039;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (244 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Unchou Kan-u Seito Warlord S Queen&#039;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Unchou_Kan-u_Seito_Warlord_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Unchou Kan-u Seito Warlord S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (244 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Unchou Kan-u Seito Warlord S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Unchou_Kan-u_Seito_Warlord_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/5/53/Unchou_Kan-u_Seito_Warlord_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20251018002840\" /></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Unchou_Kan-u_SW_Lord_of_Thundercloud_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:78px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Unchou_Kan-u_SW_Lord_of_Thundercloud_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Unchou Kan-u SW Lord of Thundercloud Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (350 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:78px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/11/Unchou_Kan-u_SW_Lord_of_Thundercloud_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/78?cb=20251018002839\" title=\"Unchou Kan-u SW Lord of Thundercloud Queen&#039;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (350 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Unchou Kan-u SW Lord of Thundercloud Queen&#039;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Unchou_Kan-u_SW_Lord_of_Thundercloud_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Unchou Kan-u SW Lord of Thundercloud Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (350 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Unchou Kan-u SW Lord of Thundercloud Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Unchou_Kan-u_SW_Lord_of_Thundercloud_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/11/Unchou_Kan-u_SW_Lord_of_Thundercloud_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/78?cb=20251018002839\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820013808\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3934/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:40081-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260820013808 and revision id 64366. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
